1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Drawing a path is easy. Knowing the run is harder.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Bordeaux keeps the constraints in view.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:13,000
Shape the spline. Set headings, events, and local limits right where the field demands them.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Play the move back before the robot does. Time, distance, and direction remain visible together.

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:24,500
Then review that path as one part of the complete autonomous run before export.

6
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:28,500
In Aquitaine, connect paths, commands, waits, and sensor decisions together.

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:32,500
Validate typed Java events through a versioned handoff, without deploying.

8
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,500
Bordeaux. Draw the path. Know the run.
